@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title C4 L1 — Life Tracker / System Context (baseline 1.0)
left to right direction
actor "Owner" as owner
rectangle "Life Tracker\nLocal life tracking system / baseline 1.0" as system <<Software System>>
rectangle "Telegram\nMessaging service" as tg <<External System>>
rectangle "Apple ecosystem\nHealth / Screen Time" as apple <<External System>>
rectangle "T-Bank\nFinancial sources" as bank <<External System>>
rectangle "Steam\nLater stage" as steam <<External System>>
owner --> system : Assessments, diary, reviews
owner --> tg : Messages and media
system --> tg : Receive messages / deliver replies
system --> apple : Authorized data access (unverified)
system --> bank : Read data (unverified)
system ..> steam : Read gaming activity (future)
note bottom of system
No cloud inference.
External API feasibility is not confirmed.
end note
@enduml
